WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.136
-The Trump administration
announced a plan today

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:05.571
to send the National Guard
to the border.

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:08.241
Meanwhile, Trump has kept up
his attacks on Amazon.

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:10.777
For more on this it's time for
"A Closer Look."

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:15.247
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.247 --> 00:00:17.183
This has been a week
with Trump indulging

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:19.451
his various obsessions
and one of those obsessions

00:00:19.451 --> 00:00:20.987
remains our border
with Mexico.

00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:23.389
He's been fuming
about a caravan of immigrants

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:25.658
