and claiming that

00:00:25.658 --> 00:00:28.061
the border is essentially
a lawless territory.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:30.763
-Hopefully Congress
will get their act together

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:33.433
and get in and create
some very powerful laws,

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:35.568
like Mexico has
and like Canada has

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:37.703
and like almost
all countries have.

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:40.106
We don't have laws,
we have catch and release.

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:42.075
You catch and then
you immediately release.

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:44.243
It's like we have no border,

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:47.080
because we had
Obama make changes,

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.282
President Obama made changes

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:52.051
that basically created
no border.

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:53.719
It's called catch and release.

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:55.588
-That's right.
It's called catch and release.

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:58.024
Or as Trump used to call it,
marriage.

00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:00.593
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.593 --> 00:01:02.695
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:05.365
[ Whistles ]

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:08.067
-Whoo!

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.302
-[ As Trump] I don't know
how to tell you this,

00:01:10.302 --> 00:01:11.538
but it's time for release.

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:13.272
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:15.075
[ Normal voice ]
In reality, under Trump,

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.676
